cations</span> </a><!--3D模型--><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/1491ced81dfc439ab45c21ea6b4b69fc/Single-Axis_Joystick_Module_with_3Pin_SH1.0_Connector-XA009_3D_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0611/4036/9460/files/3d.svg?v=1715161943\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>Solid Model</span> </a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6;\"><em>*User's Manual: Includes product function description and configuration guidelines.</em></span></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6;\"><em>*Specifications: Essential electrical and physical parameters required for proper operation.</em></span></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6;\"><em>*Solid Model: 3D digital models used to represent the actual dimensions and structural features.</em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--Introduction-->\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Introduction</h2>\n<!---红字文本替换---->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">The Single-Axis Joystick Module is a 1-channel analog input module. It automatically returns to the center position. Compared to a <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/dual-axis-joystick-module-with-3pin-sh1-0-connectors-1pcs\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42; text-decoration: underline;\">Dual-Axis Joystick Module</span></a></strong></span>, the single-axis joystick moves in only one direction and outputs a single analog signal, making it ideal for use as a control lever in various scenarios that require speed control or position control with automatic centering — especially when the control logic of these motions needs to remain independent.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">For example, in a vehicle model, one single-axis joystick module can be used to control the speed of movement, and another to control the steering; or in a tower crane model, a single-axis joystick module can control the lifting of the hook; or in a tracked vehicle model, two single-axis joystick modules can be used to independently control the speed of each track.</p>\n<!--Specification-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\"><!--Banner-->\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: center; width: 100%;\"><!---图片链接替换----><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/0621a968e07e4f7f9045884c912e7a60/XA009.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobi