nd-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">Size</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 15px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; height: 15px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"OsAldE1cUoGAUQxg1D4cwL9Xnqc\">XA009</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 16.6547%; padding: 10px !important;\">SW311</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">3.3V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">ADC</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">1CH</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">Potentiometer</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">10kΩ</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">3-Pin SH1.0</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">6.15g</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">34*27mm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">Important Notices</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Included accessory</strong>: The product comes with a 100mm Wire with 3Pin SH1.0 Connectors.</li>\n<li><strong>Choking hazard</strong>: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The Single-Axis Joystick Module is a 1-channel analog input module. It automatically returns to the center position. Compared to a Dual-Axis Joystick Module, the single-axis joystick moves in only one direction and outputs a single analog signal, making it ideal for use as a control lever in various scenarios that require speed control or position control with automatic centering — especially when the control logic of these motions needs to remain independent.\n\nFor example, in a vehicle model, one single-axis joystick module can be used to control the speed of movement, and another to control the steering; or in a tower crane model, a single-axis joystick module can control the lifting of the hook; or in a tracked vehicle model, two single-axis joystick modules can be used to independently control the speed of each track.\n\nIncluded accessory: The product comes with a 100mm Wire with 3Pin SH1.0 Connectors.\n\nChoking hazard: This product contains small parts. Keep out of reach of children to avoid accidental ingestion.",
